// Reproducible RC step used by the Python/Jupyter research-data workflow.
// Ideal 1 V input, 1 ms time constant; the comparison data is explicitly synthetic.
param resistance: Ohm = 1kOhm
param capacitance: F = 1uF
net GND
net IN
net OUT
source VIN pwl(0s,0V,1ns,1V,10ms,1V)
resistor R1 {resistance}
capacitor C1 {capacitance}
connect VIN.plus, R1.p1 to IN
connect VIN.minus, C1.p2 to GND
connect R1.p2, C1.p1 to OUT
simulate tran 10us 5ms
